<th id="S3.T1.6.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">MedLFQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jeong et al., 2024</a>)</cite></th>
<td id="S3.T1.6.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1</td>
